## Test Assets

Upload test files:

- `src/test/assets/files/`

Rules:

- only safe synthetic files;
- no `.env`;
- no secrets;
- no real personal data;
- no tokens;
- no cookies;
- no storage state files;
- no credentials files.

Usage:

- use this folder for files uploaded in UI tests;
- do not upload files from project root;
- do not upload configuration files;
- do not upload real user files.

---

## Reporting

Allure reporter:

- configured in `playwright.config.ts`

Allure metadata helper:

- `src/test/reporting/allure-metadata.helper.ts`

Allure configuration skill:

- `.cursor/skills/configure-allure-reporting/SKILL.md`

Rules:

- UI and API specs may use the shared Allure metadata helper;
- specs own concrete Allure metadata values;
- shared reporting helpers own reusable metadata application logic;
- Page Objects and Components must not use Allure;
- API clients must not use Allure;
- builders and generators must not use Allure;
- attachments must be sanitized;
- secrets, tokens, cookies, passwords, `.env`, and storage state files must never be attached.

Future extension:

- create `src/test/reporting/allure-api-diagnostics.helper.ts` only when sanitized API request/response attachments are required.

