## Visual Testing

Visual tests:

- UI visual tests live under `tests/ui/` unless another location is defined here.

Visual tag:

- `@visual`

Rules:

- visual tests must also keep the layer tag, such as `@ui`;
- visual assertions live in specs;
- Page Objects and Components must not call `toHaveScreenshot`;
- visual tests must not replace functional assertions;
- dynamic content must be masked or avoided;
- baselines must be updated intentionally;
- visual tests must not screenshot secrets or sensitive data.

Skill:

- `.cursor/skills/implement-visual-test/SKILL.md`

